  "source": {
    "url": "https://assets-cdn.liebherr.com/versions/ed8ca573-03c0-4a9f-91dc-8c6797801c7c/original/",
    "title": "Liebherr Technical data - Mobile crane LTM 1110-5.2 [m/t] (liebherr-305-ltm-1110-5.2-td-305-03-defisr06-2024, linked from liebherr.com product page)",
    "page": "18 (load chart t_305_001_09001_00_000 / maxt_305_001_02001_00_000); dimensions p.3",
    "retrieved": "2026-09-24"
  },
  "notes": "SUBSTITUTE MODEL: the requested LTM 1110-5.1 is no longer on liebherr.com (its successor LTM 1110-5.2 is listed); the only 5.1 chart found was a retyped rental-company table (cadmancranes.com), not an official datasheet, so the current official LTM 1110-5.2 datasheet is used instead. Values from p.18 (360°, 29 t, marked 'Verbesserte Traglasten / Improved load capacity'; all T tables in this datasheet carry that label). 15 boom lengths in source; 22.6, 37.5 and 58.1 m omitted to keep 12 columns. The 11.5 m boom has an over-rear (±0°) '*' sub-column (110 t at 3 m = headline rating) which is NOT stored. Outrigger span not printed on the table; longitudinal 7.915 m (lower chain; upper 7.841 m), transverse 8.315 m max (VarioBase 2.456-8.315 m; intermediate 5.386 / 6.85 m). Max supporting force 721 kN (74 t), p.13. Operating weight not stated: jobsite ≤ 80 t with 29 t counterweight; on-road ≤ 48 t (10 t axles) with 1.1 t (p.15). maxHookHeight not taken (graph only). Slew centre is 45 mm ahead of axle 4 (drawing). Tail radius R = 4100 mm at the counterweight; R = 4310 mm includes a lightly drawn (optional) rear item. Overall length 14.039 m incl. that item (13.843 / 13.574 m shown too). Width B = 2.75 m. Dims from the side/top dimension drawing: overallLength_m = carrier length (bottom dimension chain, carrier front to rear); axle positions and slew centre are cumulative sums of that chain, measured from the carrier front. Height/width = columns A/B-or-C of the dimension table for the standard 385/95 R 25 (14.00 R 25) tyres. wheelDiameter_m is NOT from the drawing: nominal value computed from the tyre designation (25 in rim + 2 x 95% x 385 mm = 1.37 m). Boom pivot height/offset are not dimensioned on the drawing (null). Liebherr remarks: hook block weight is part of the load (chartIncludesHookBlock true). Dimension reference corrected: the datasheet's bottom dimension chain starts at the front of the boom head (transport position, boom overhanging the cab), not at the carrier front bumper. overallLength_m is now the carrier length (front bumper to rear) and axlePositions_m / slewCentreFromFront_m are measured from the carrier front bumper; the boom head overhang ahead of the bumper is stored as boomOverhangFront_m = 1.188 m (overall transport length incl. boom = 13.428 m). Evidence (dimensions drawing p.3): chain 1188 | 12240 = 13428, carrier chain 2440 | 2500 | 1650 | 2010 | 1650 | 1990 = 12240; slew centre 45 ahead of 4th axle (13574 - 3831 = 9743 from boom head)."
